- Fetching the next page of search results or the individual artist detail pages will supply the missing fields (`display_name`, `birth_place`, `nationality`) necessary to evaluate Pennsylvania‑born American women. It may also reveal artist‑level metadata that can be cross‑referenced with painting records.
